  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Shifters, sometimes called \"weretouched,\" descend from people who caught lycanthropy in full or in part. Humanoids with a bestial side, they can't fully change shape, but they can briefly bring out their animal features, which they call \"shifting.\"</p><p>Shifters have the height and build of humans but are usually leaner and more flexible. Their faces have a bestial cast, often with large eyes and pointed ears, and most have prominent canines; fur-like hair grows over most of their body. Even at their most feral, they remain clearly Humanoid.</p><h3>Shifter Traits</h3><p><strong>Creature Type:</strong> Humanoid</p><p><strong>Size:</strong> Medium (about 4–7 feet tall) or Small (about 2–4 feet tall), chosen when you select this species</p><p><strong>Speed:</strong> 30 feet</p><p><strong>Darkvision:</strong> 60 feet</p><p><strong>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.species.Item.9rU5xi7MJb4K6UvV]{Bestial Instincts}.</strong> Channeling the beast within, you gain proficiency in one of the following skills of your choice: Acrobatics, Athletics, Intimidation, or Survival.</p><p><strong>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.species.Item.vKj3KB3UlTovQFS6]{Shifting}.</strong> As a Bonus Action, a number of times per Long Rest equal to your Proficiency Bonus, you shift for 1 minute, gaining Temporary Hit Points equal to twice your Proficiency Bonus and the benefit of your option (Beasthide, Longtooth, Swiftstride, or Wildhunt).</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
